32	    /// Returns the [Case] of `value`.
33	    ///
34	    /// If `strict` is `true`, then two consecutive uppercase characters are not
35	    /// allowed in camelCase and PascalCase.
36	    /// For instance, `HTTPServer` is not considered in _PascalCase_ when `strict` is `true`.
37	    ///
38	    /// A figure is considered both uppercase and lowercase.
39	    /// Thus, `V8_ENGINE` is in _CONSTANt_CASE_ and `V8Engine` is in _PascalCase_.
40	    ///
41	    /// ### Examples
42	    ///
43	    /// ```
44	    /// use biome_js_analyze::utils::case::Case;
45	    ///
46	    /// assert_eq!(Case::identify("aHttpServer", /* no effect */ true), Case::Camel);
